      title: "Matching flag onesies for the Fourth of July, Calvin Harris included",
      summary: "Gigi Hadid and Joe Jonas brought American-flag onesies for the whole group; Ed Sheeran, the HAIM sisters, and boyfriend Calvin Harris rounded out the guest list at the Rhode Island beach house.",
      body: ["The 2015 edition of Taylor's Rhode Island Independence Day tradition drew Calvin Harris (her boyfriend at the time), Ed Sheeran, Joe Jonas, Nick Jonas, Gigi Hadid, brother Austin Swift, and the HAIM sisters.", "Hadid and Jonas brought matching American-flag onesies for the group, and the party featured what E! called \"the biggest inflatable slide,\" piggyback rides, and Taylor doing the cooking, under sunny East Coast weather ahead of that evening's fireworks."],
