      date: "2021-06-18",
      dateLabel: "June 18, 2021",
      title: "A vintage Chevrolet, a burgundy cap, and the Red (Taylor's Version) cover",
      summary: "Beige peacoat, red lipstick, and a sold-out-within-hours burgundy velvet \"Mattie\" cap by independent designer Janessa Leoné, shot in a 1932 Chevrolet Cabriolet.",
      body: ["Leoné had no advance notice her \"Mattie\" cap would appear on the cover, telling Billboard: \"It came as a total surprise to see her sport Mattie on the album cover — we were genuinely shocked, but thrilled.\"", "She said the shoot was not a team collaboration — Taylor's stylist chose the piece independently — and the cap sold out on Leoné's site immediately after the reveal on June 18, 2021."],
      tags: ["Fashion"],
