      title: "The \"willow\" video's final scene: a Gucci Liberty-print floral maxi dress",
      summary: "Beyond the Zimmermann \"bridal\" gown, the video's closing scene puts her in a $4,800 Gucci maxi dress made from Liberty London floral fabric — a third, lesser-discussed look from the same shoot.",
      body: ["Steal Her Style's breakdown of the \"willow\" video counts three distinct looks: a Magnolia Pearl \"Layla\" tank dress over her own \"cardigan\" merch sweater for the opening scene; the Zimmermann \"Charm Star\" lace gown with Jennifer Behr tiara for the \"wedding\" scene.", "For the video's final scene: a Gucci maxi dress made from Liberty of London floral-print fabric, retailing around $4,800 — a look far less discussed by fans than the \"bridal\" Zimmermann gown but confirmed as part of the same December 2020 shoot."],
