      title: "Video of the Year for All Too Well — then she announces Midnights from the podium",
      summary: "Aug. 28, 2022: the short film takes the VMAs' top prize, and mid-acceptance she drops it — \"I thought it might be a fun moment to tell you that my brand-new album comes out October 21.\" The evermore era ended live on camera.",
      body: ["The short film swept its categories that night — Video of the Year plus Best Longform Video and Best Direction, the direction prize for Taylor's own work behind the camera.", "At midnight her socials revealed the title, Midnights — \"the stories of 13 sleepless nights scattered throughout my life.\" The Moschino star romper she wore to the after-party, already reading as a teaser, is covered in this era's sighting items."],
