      title: "Steak, wine, and a rare London date night at Hawksmoor",
      summary: "Taylor and Joe Alwyn were photographed holding hands leaving Hawksmoor Seven Dials, a Covent Garden steakhouse, after a two-and-a-half-hour dinner during a break in the reputation Stadium Tour.",
      body: ["On August 22, 2018, during a five-day break from touring, Taylor and Alwyn dined at Hawksmoor Seven Dials in Covent Garden, arriving around 8 p.m. with security and leaving hand in hand roughly two and a half hours later.", "They reportedly shared fillet steaks with spinach and mac and cheese, toasting with wine in a private section of the restaurant. Taylor wore an off-the-shoulder green dress and a necklace bearing Alwyn's initial."],
      tags: ["Lore"],
