      body: ["Photographed March 30, 2012 in Beverly Hills; Just Jared Jr. reported she'd eaten alongside mom Andrea and \"good friend Dianna Agron (not pictured).\"", "Swift and the Glee star had grown close that year while Taylor was recording Red between tour dates. The next day, Taylor received Nickelodeon's Big Help Award from Michelle Obama at the Kids' Choice Awards."],
