      date: "2025-12-10",
      dateLabel: "December 10, 2025",
      title: "First time on Colbert's couch, with a docuseries to launch",
      summary: "Promoting The End of an Era and The Final Show two days before their Disney+ arrival, she recapped a \"good year\" — engaged, masters back — and gamely started ranking her own top five Taylor Swift songs.",
      body: ["Her first-ever Late Show sit-down closed out 2025's press cycle: the engagement, the masters buyback, the Eras docuseries and concert film, and Colbert's parlor-game challenge to name her five favorite of her own songs — a list she only partially committed to on air. The main interview segment is on the show's official channel, with the rest of the conversation split across further official clips."],
