      id: "vault-ttpd-grammys-night-six-nominations-zero-wins-and-the-moment-every",
      date: "2025-02-02",
      dateLabel: "February 2, 2025",
      title: "Grammys night: six nominations, zero wins — and the moment everyone kept anyway",
      summary: "TTPD goes 0-for-6 at the 2025 Grammys. The image that survives the night isn't a loss — it's Taylor presenting Best Country Album to a stunned Beyoncé for Cowboy Carter, one Album of the Year titan handing the genre trophy to the other.",
      body: ["The Feb. 2, 2025 ceremony resolved all six nominations against her: Album of the Year went to Beyoncé's Cowboy Carter, \"Not Like Us\" swept Record of the Year, Song of the Year, and Best Music Video past \"Fortnight,\" \"Die With a Smile\" took Best Pop Duo/Group Performance over \"us.,\" and Sabrina Carpenter's Short n' Sweet beat TTPD for Best Pop Vocal Album. Cameras kept finding her having a good night anyway — raising a glass when Kendrick Lamar's record swept, cheering when her tour opener Sabrina won.", "The beat everyone kept came mid-show: Taylor presenting Best Country Album to a visibly stunned Beyoncé — her first-ever country win, from the artist whose own country-to-pop arc made her the category's most famous graduate. When Cowboy Carter later took Album of the Year, Taylor and Jay-Z clinked champagne glasses in the audience — a graceful coda to a night the internet had framed all week as a face-off."],
      tags: ["Lore"],
      images: [{ url: "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aGn3HgbqRC8/maxresdefault.jpg", credit: "Recording Academy / GRAMMYs (official acceptance video, YouTube)", caption: "Beyoncé accepts the Best Country Album Grammy that Taylor presented — the first Black woman to win the category.", kind: "primary", focalPoint: "50% 28%" }, { url: "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CReGebxw4Ko/maxresdefault.jpg", credit: "Recording Academy / GRAMMYs (official fashion-cam video, YouTube)", caption: "The Red-era callback on the carpet: sparkling one-shoulder Vivienne Westwood with ruby chandelier earrings — worn to a night that ended 0-for-6.", kind: "primary", focalPoint: "52% 28%" }],
      sources: [{ name: "Fox News", url: "https://www.foxnews.com/entertainment/taylor-swift-leaves-grammys-no-awards-following-record-breaking-year" }, { name: "NBC Connecticut", url: "https://www.nbcconnecticut.com/entertainment/entertainment-news/beyonce-wins-grammy-best-country-album-taylor-swift/3489643/" }, { name: "E! News", url: "https://www.eonline.com/news/1412913/grammys-2025-how-taylor-swift-and-jay-z-celebrated-beyonces-aoty-win-together" }, { name: "Billboard", url: "https://www.billboard.com/music/awards/beyonce-cowboy-carter-grammy-best-country-album-2025-1235890352/" }, { name: "WWD", url: "https://wwd.com/pop-culture/celebrity-news/taylor-swift-red-dress-grammys-1236899833/" }],
